# Longitudinal Dietary Trajectory Analysis: VITALUM Secondary Analysis Pipeline

This repository contains the statistical scripts and workflow procedures supporting the paper:

> **Heterogeneous Trajectories of Fruit and Vegetable Intake Following a Behavioural Intervention in Older Adults: Secondary Analysis of the VITALUM Randomised Trial**[cite: 1]  
> *A. Misir, V. Lima Passos, and I. Mesters*[cite: 1]

