## 1. Pipeline Overview

The statistical workflow is partitioned across three environments:

1. **SAS 9.4 (`PROC TRAJ`)**: Unconditional Group-Based Trajectory Modelling (GBTM) and class enumeration ($k = 1$ to $10$).


2. **R 4.2.0** *(standalone scripts)*: Model fit assessment via F-CAP, generation of trajectory plots, Cramér's $V$ heatmaps, and odds ratio forest plots.


3. **IBM SPSS Statistics 28.0**: Bivariate cross-tabulations and multivariable multinomial logistic regression.



---

## 2. SAS Syntax: Latent Class Enumeration (k = 1 to 10)

This macro automates the unconditional quadratic censored normal (`CNORM`) GBTM estimation across 1 to 10 trajectory groups for vegetable intake (`a1`–`a3`) and centered intake (`ac1`–`ac3`), systematically exporting the parameter estimates (`fcap_bic_*.csv`) and individual posterior assignment probabilities (`fcap_prob_*.csv`) needed for the F-CAP R scripts.

```sas
/* ========================================================================== */
/* STEP 1: GBTM CLASS ENUMERATION (SAS 9.4 PROC TRAJ)                        */
/* ========================================================================== */

/* Relative directory path for exporting diagnostic outputs */
%let project_path = ./output/vegetables;

%macro run_gbtm_enumeration;
  %do k = 1 %to 10;
    
    /* Construct polynomial order string of degree 2 for k classes */
    %let ord = ;
    %do i = 1 %to &k;
      %let ord = &ord 2;
    %end;

    /* Execute PROC TRAJ for k classes */
    PROC TRAJ DATA=WORK.am 
              OUT=OF 
              OUTEST=OE 
              OUTPLOT=OP 
              OUTSTAT=OS 
              OUTPLOT2=op2 
              OUTSTAT2=os2;
      ID ID; 
      VAR a1-a3; 
      INDEP t0-t2;
      MODEL CNORM; 
      MIN 0; 
      MAX 500; 
      NGROUPS &k; 
      ORDER &ord;
      
      VAR2 ac1-ac3; 
      INDEP2 t0-t2;
      MODEL2 CNORM; 
      MIN2 -210; 
      MAX2 220; 
      NGROUPS &k; 
      ORDER2 &ord;
      
      MULTGROUPS &k;
    RUN;

    /* Plot trajectory profiles */
    %TRAJPLOTNEW(OP, OS, "Vegetable Intake - &k Classes");
    %TRAJPLOT(OP, OS, "Vegetable Intake - &k Classes");

    /* Export model fit statistics and BIC for R F-CAP processing */
    PROC EXPORT DATA=Work.Oe 
                OUTFILE="&project_path/fcap_bic_&k..csv" 
                DBMS=CSV REPLACE;
    RUN;

    /* Export posterior assignment probabilities for R F-CAP processing */
    PROC EXPORT DATA=Work.Of 
                OUTFILE="&project_path/fcap_prob_&k..csv" 
                DBMS=CSV REPLACE;
    RUN;
    
  %end;
%mend run_gbtm_enumeration;

/* Run enumeration loop */
%run_gbtm_enumeration;

```

