## 4. SPSS Syntax: Cross-Tabulations

Calculates contingency distributions and symmetric measures between assigned vegetable intake trajectory groups (`VegeRT4`) and behavioral determinant trajectory groups (e.g., habit strength `HabitVR`):

```spss
* ==============================================================================
* STEP 2: CROSS-TABULATIONS AND CONTINGENCY ANALYSES (SPSS 28.0)
* ==============================================================================

CROSSTABS 
  /TABLES=VegeRT4 BY HabitVR 
  /FORMAT=AVALUE TABLES 
  /STATISTICS=CHISQ PHI 
  /CELLS=COUNT ROW COLUMN TOTAL 
  /COUNT ROUND CELL 
  /BARCHART.

```

