## 5. SPSS Syntax: Multinomial Logistic Regression

Estimates the final multivariable multinomial logistic regression model predicting vegetable intake trajectory membership from determinants and sociodemographics, using **Minimal Consumers** as the reference category.

```spss
* ==============================================================================
* STEP 3: MULTINOMIAL LOGISTIC REGRESSION (SPSS 28.0)
* ==============================================================================

/* Note: Habit trajectories 1 and 2 are collapsed into a single category */
/* (HabitVRMul_Colapse) to resolve quasi-complete separation.           */

NOMREG VegeRT4 (BASE=FIRST ORDER=ASCENDING) 
  BY GENDER Intervention AwarenessVRMul HabitVRMul_Colapse AttitudeVRMul_Collapsed ModelingVRMul 
  WITH AGE 
  /CRITERIA CIN(95) DELTA(0) MXITER(100) MXSTEP(5) CHKSEP(20) LCONVERGE(0) PCONVERGE(0.000001) 
    SINGULAR(0.00000001) 
  /MODEL 
  /STEPWISE=PIN(.05) POUT(0.1) MINEFFECT(0) RULE(SINGLE) ENTRYMETHOD(LR) REMOVALMETHOD(LR) 
  /INTERCEPT=INCLUDE 
  /PRINT=PARAMETER SUMMARY LRT CPS STEP MFI.

```

